    "sub_name": "高分子加工",
    "sub_ename": "POLYMER PROCESSING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程分為二個部份，基礎高分子流變學與高分子加工概論，流變學包括流體力學、黏度與量測、剪切與拉伸黏度、高分子黏彈性等。高分子加工概論包括紡紗加工、光學膜加工、押出加工、射出加工、貼合加工等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course contains 2 parts, rheology & processing . The first one deals with viscosity and measurement, including shear and tensile viscosity, phenomena related with polymer rheology will be discussed. 5 basic processing process, fiber spinning, biaxial stretching film, extrusion, injection molding and lamination will also be included.",
